                            <comment id="17271142" author="ptupitsyn" created="Mon, 25 Jan 2021 08:12:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Caused by &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13075&quot; title=&quot;NPE on request JDBC metadata&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-13075&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-13075&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: key prop is always &lt;tt&gt;notNull&lt;/tt&gt;, we don&apos;t need to invoke query entity validation for that, and we did not do this before those changes.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
